# Work branch and preview

## Branch policy

- **Always work on `work`.** Do not commit, push, or open PRs targeting `main` unless Alex explicitly asks.
- At the start of a session (or before the first edit), verify the current branch. If not on `work`:
  - If `work` exists: `git checkout work`
  - Otherwise: `git checkout -b work`
- Push changes to `origin/work` only. Never push to `main`.

This keeps production deploys on `main` stable and saves Netlify build minutes.

## Fixed preview URL

Base: `https://deploy-preview-1--web-evolution-2026.netlify.app`

Append paths for review links (e.g. `/`, `/new`, `/ParallaxHero`). Do not use localhost or the production URL unless Alex asks.
